1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Magna Carta, that's the power that can cause earthquakes or make it rain.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,000
But you need a bunch of sacred treasures to make it work, right?

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Yes, the more of the sacred treasures you possess, the more power you can call forth.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
If we could use the Magna Carta, then we could get revenge on the Yossil.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:33,000
You will never be able to use the Magna Carta if you think like that.

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Why not?

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The Magna Carta is unbelievably powerful.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Unless you have the necessary training, you won't be able to use it.

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Then I'll become stronger.

10
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Listen, Mano, the Magna Carta can be evoked regardless of one's strength.

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
But first, you must understand how this world works.
